{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1000_p", "source_sha256": "95f743ace15eff518c7bf4a1875c7c473a857aa298e90ad9c04eb538f5da0103", "ja": "（今日は休日の学校の屋上で『アイグラ！！』の\n撮影だ。そろそろエミリーも休憩に入るころか……）", "zh": "（今天在放假的学校顶楼拍摄《I‧G‧R‧A！！》照片。\n艾蜜莉也差不多要进入休息时间了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8835e8b590db932896dd0d71d037738cac6e0df7930c6cf1e502cc5abb5edad3", "ja": "お疲れさま、エミリー。\n撮影、順調みたいだな。", "zh": "艾蜜莉，辛苦你了。\n拍摄似乎很顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "b72f6f7147875308c62b4255d94ec4807c8a12fcc94f88fda32577023d0102f1", "ja": "お疲れさまです、仕掛け人さま。はい、\nいつもと違う制服での撮影、新鮮で楽しいです！", "zh": "策划执行人先生，您也辛苦了。\n嗯，穿着与平常不同的制服拍摄，感觉既新鲜又有趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "baf2c4042c6298a4be4db9b0bc961125c7cccd016bf50aadb4fad6557654c926", "ja": "でも、不思議です。\nどうして教室ではなく、屋上で撮影なのでしょう？", "zh": "不过，我觉得很奇妙。\n为何是在顶楼拍摄，而不是在教室里呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5c9e953ce5d9a05184be9e65b0fca08d8d5b731720a78a401b0c9286f7114e52", "ja": "学園物のドラマなんかだと、定番だけど……普通は、\nどこの学校の屋上も、立ち入り禁止かもしれないな。", "zh": "这在青春校园剧里是经典场景……但一般来说，\n不管哪一所学校的顶楼好像都禁止进入。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "79b412b97af54884730ecc5931febd86355b8f1ef6dd13a8692011635e132dca", "ja": "定番……そうなのですか。\nたとえば、どんな場面で使われるのでしょう？", "zh": "经典场景……原来如此。\n举例来说，会出现在哪一种情境中呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a62abad58aa9dc54b6550cd9c58a06905813f6f30e9e86a4c46c2c9e59225794", "ja": "そうだな、色々ある気がするけど……\n恋愛ものだと、告白シーンとかかな？", "zh": "这个嘛，感觉会出现在很多情境中……\n在恋爱剧中，大概是出现在告白桥段吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "9d1839cba2a789fd29ed68613ad0b0db147885f5431ee228bdcd75064b91612b", "ja": "こ、告白場面……ですか！？", "zh": "告、告白桥段……是吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1008_p", "source_sha256": "57dd6dfa8164702afa1cd7a39dfb9e9fe25cee101e60da8cdb8680fc11578730", "ja": "あ、もしかしたら日本だけなのかな？　屋上といえば\n青春、中でも告白に使われるイメージなんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，说不定只有日本是这样？说到顶楼就会想到青春，\n也会给人一种告白时要在顶楼的印象……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "cbde157d94553fec0a90eb43f639a8ecd81642876d8dd3aa4f6b020d692c0677", "ja": "な、なるほど。告白といえば屋上……\nそれが、日本の作法なのですね？", "zh": "原、原来如此，告白就要在顶楼……\n这就是日本的规矩吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1010_p", "source_sha256": "bdd1b649be874a8b81322201df7d5e39f6e16c3e24229ede13a334d1fd177696", "ja": "もしエミリーに学園ドラマの仕事がきたら、\nそういう経験をするかもしれないな。", "zh": "如果艾蜜莉接到校园剧的工作，\n也许就能体验一下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "40326d879487e8796d12a7b33d463d1350b071a09d4c4a888d95969009593ff3", "ja": "わ、私がですか！？\nそんな……私、こ、告白だなんて……。", "zh": "我、我吗！？\n怎么可以……要、要我去告白……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5496e6f0ff7339189a2b88132b88550a64a8379cb88d686eb305f9537b1ec18a", "ja": "エミリーは13歳だったな。\nまだ、想像がつかないかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "艾蜜莉你现在13岁吧。\n你可能还想像不出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ba500baed44427b4f71d714ed5ed1925b6ddcb90e02be7dcc1e11bc327c74554", "ja": "恋愛ものの青春ドラマとか、\nそういう仕事が来たって、おかしくないと思うよ。", "zh": "但你即使接到青春恋爱剧之类的\n工作邀约也不奇怪喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "802f6ba1c6afef528483fc53f5c672253dcd175dc0ca45581de5cf039ddfd0f7", "ja": "仕掛け人さま……。", "zh": "策划执行人先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "8ccc31decf21f9b559e45d324d49720c82153fd6e1e53826c4049e41450de0ec", "ja": "では……あの、もし……もし本当に、\nそういうお仕事の話をいただいたら、なのですが……。", "zh": "那么……那个，如果……\n如果真的接到了那种工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "d084f1d1dc4ee4136d4ea2c8e7d2b1b02f736d71000d38a551957cdb8e31f953", "ja": "私は、そ、そういった経験がないので……その時は\n仕掛け人さまが、練習に付き合ってくださいますか？", "zh": "但我没有那、那种经验……\n到时候策划执行人先生可以陪我练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6ed2a4bb3741a73bb7f7340e42664a20de7b347893c2967736e4b4a5ee8c8766", "ja": "え？\nああ、それはもちろん構わないけど……。", "zh": "咦？\n啊，当然没有问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "4ccf79d4550a80ec9934f814246e247eb79f97386f857ca921efd9c7913f4c7d", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　では仕掛け人さまは、\nそれまでに告白の言葉を考えておいてくださいね♪", "zh": "非常感谢您！那么，策划执行人先生，\n请您在那之前想好告白台词喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1019_p", "source_sha256": "30783e9b25e488a5651c6fc04cdc6552ae68fe3403193643b470521d4e7b7fea", "ja": "ああ、わかった……えっ！？\n練習って、俺が告白する側の役なのか？", "zh": "好，我知道……咦！？\n你说的练习是叫我演告白的人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "0019cb0cfe7e94a84fe3555d1463f5c60fec2acf44d22635bb6d6930eaa5fbf4", "ja": "だって、大和撫子が自分から告白だなんて……。\nは、はしたなく思われてしまいそうですから……。", "zh": "因为大和抚子主动去告白……\n好、好像会被人认为很不得体……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0113_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "11ee045d7779fa805d1c8ce42d7ab08aed0d4eb535e57e3a1004c20cd6a75903", "ja": "あの……仕掛け人さま？\n告白、お待ちしておりますね♪", "zh": "那个……策划执行人先生，\n我会等您来告白喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
